<view class="page home">
  <view class="between masthead"><view class="row"><view class="brand-mark"></view><text class="eyebrow">巅峰人生 · LIFE INDEX</text></view><text class="eyebrow num">VOL. 01</text></view>
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="tag">全方位生活测试</view>
    <view class="hero-title"><view>你的人生，</view><view>是什么配置？</view></view>
    <view class="hero-sub"><view>了解你当前六个方面的生活状态，</view><view>以及那个有点好笑、又有点像你的自己。</view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="dimension-strip"><view wx:for="{{axes}}" wx:key="id" class="dimension-item"><ui-icon name="{{item.icon}}" size="30" /><text>{{item.name}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error space" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="start-area">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onStart"><text>{{hasDraft ? '继续上次测试' : '测出我的生活配置'}}</text><ui-icon name="arrow" color="white" size="38" /></button>
    <view class="caption start-meta">{{count}} 道选择题 · 选完自动下一题<text wx:if="{{hasDraft}}"> · 已答 {{answered}} 题</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="home-links"><button class="text-btn" bindtap="onRecords"><ui-icon name="history" color="muted" size="28" />历史报告</button><view class="link-divider"></view><button class="text-btn" bindtap="onAbout">数据与隐私<ui-icon name="chevron" color="muted" size="26" /></button></view>
  <view class="footer-note"><view>打开即用，不获取头像、昵称或手机号。</view><view>结果由你的实际作答生成；具体收入、存款不会出现在分享卡中。</view></view>
</view>
